# Third-party content in BattleBox

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code. The art, sounds, fonts and
building kits were made by other people, under their own terms, and this
file is the record of which is which.

Nothing is bundled here that its licence does not allow to be
redistributed. If you believe something is, please open an issue and it
will be removed the same day.

## Art and sound — Kenney, CC0 1.0 (public domain)

<https://kenney.nl> · <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>

| Pack | Where it is | What it is |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Blocky Characters | `game/assets/models/chars/`, `game/assets/ui/chars/` | The 18 playable characters and their portraits |
| Cube Pets | `game/assets/models/pets/` | The 11 animals |
